    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your patron is a noble dao of the Elemental Plane of Earth. Dao are the noble genies of the Elemental Plane of Earth: greedy, arrogant lords of mines and gem-studded palaces who measure everything in wealth.</p><p><strong>Genie's Wrath.</strong> The extra damage of your Genie's Wrath is Bludgeoning damage.</p><p><strong>Elemental Gift.</strong> At Warlock level 6, your Elemental Gift grants you Resistance to Bludgeoning damage.</p><p><strong>Genie Spells.</strong> Your kind adds the following spells to your Genie Spells: @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbSanctuary0000]{Sanctuary}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSpikeGrowt]{Spike Growth} (level 3); @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMeldintoSt]{Meld into Stone} (level 5); @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplStoneShape]{Stone Shape} (level 7); @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWallofSton]{Wall of Stone} (level 9).</p>",
